h-Hans\">她被编织吸收了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">歯磨き</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はみがき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">刷牙；牙齿清洁；牙膏；牙粉；洁齿剂</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"150919\"><ruby>歯磨<rp>(</rp><rt>はみが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きをしなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">刷牙</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">はめる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">嵌入；装入；固定（如将玻璃板嵌入框架、将软木塞插入、扣紧纽扣等）；套上；戴上（指环绕身体的物品，如戒指、手套）；套住；连接（如将软管连到水龙头）；将…分门别类；强行纳入某种模式；施加（限制）；诱骗；陷害；欺骗；投入；扔进；发生性关系；性交</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227451\">オレ、うまくハメられた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我被陷害得相当好</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">早い</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はやい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">快；迅速；敏捷；高速；早；尽早；比平时更早；过早；为时尚早；容易；简单；快捷；一…就…；刚…就…；瞬间…</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"150671\"><ruby>時<rp>(</rp><rt>とき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のたつのは<ruby>早<rp>(</rp><rt>はや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いものだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">时间匆匆经过。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/5551139\" title=\"Tatoeba · verdastelo9604\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · verdastelo9604\" target=\"_blank\"